outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [261], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [8], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "Float (Duration)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [269.984375, 70], "pos": [-1480, 5830], "id": 132, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [279], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["【Reference Material Notes】\n\n@Image 1 serves as the sole reference for the protagonist’s identity and appearance. The portrait, front, back, side views, and facial expressions all belong to the same character; only one female lead may appear in the video. Strictly maintain deep brown skin, brown eyes, short thick white braided hair, blue eye-socket facial markings, pink scarf, white and orange futuristic armor, light beige work pants, a single mechanical prosthetic limb, consistent facial features, and body proportions. The character design must not be mirrored.\n\n@Image 2 is the sole scene reference. Maintain a futuristic industrial transport base floating above a cloud sea: a massive central concrete structure, suspended tracks and pipelines, white and orange modular containers, observation towers, a pale blue sky, dense clouds, and a distant giant coral-red sun in the horizon.\n\n@Image 3 is the sole reference for the hovering robot. Multiple angles shown depict the same unit; only one robot may appear in the video. Maintain a white spherical body, orange armored segments, a central glowing cyan monocular lens, two ducted fans on either side, two small mechanical arms, and smooth, proportionally consistent form. The robot's design must not be mirrored.\n\n@Audio 1 uses the segment from 0:00 to 0:08 as the sound and rhythm reference. Preserve the original audio’s overall timbre, spatial sense, beat structure, and dynamic variations—no added dialogue. Changes in shot composition, robot entrance, and environmental reveal should naturally follow the distinct rhythmic cues in the audio, avoiding rigid timing or frequent cuts.\n\n【Core Concept】\n\nProduce an 8-second, 16:9 horizontal, high-quality stylized 3D sci-fi game-style CG animation. The heroine stands at the edge of a cloud-based industrial base, accompanied by a hovering robot positioned slightly behind and to her left. The shot begins with an extremely close-up of the heroine’s right eye, then smoothly and continuously pulls back, progressively revealing her face, outfit, the robot, platform, and finally the full-scale aerial base in a sweeping wide-angle panoramic view. The entire sequence is a single unbroken take—no cuts or transitions.\n\n【8-Second Visual Breakdown】\n\n0–1.3 seconds: Extreme close-up of the heroine’s right eye, nearly filling the frame. Iris, lashes, and eyeliner are clearly defined; the pupil faintly reflects the coral-red sun. She maintains a steady gaze, with only subtle natural eye movement. Focus remains tightly locked on the eye, shallow depth of field, background fully blurred.\n\nAt approximately 1.3 seconds, when the audio rhythm shifts, the camera begins a stable backward motion along the line of sight from the heroine’s eye.\n\n1.3–2.4 seconds: The camera continues pulling back, gradually revealing eyebrows, blue facial markings, nose bridge, and full face. The heroine stares calmly into the lens, head mostly still, breathing naturally. Her short thick white braid remains structurally consistent. Cyan ambient light and pink sidelight create a restrained pink-to-blue gradient across her face, though the shape of the blue markings must remain unchanged.\n\nAt around 2.4 seconds, the full face is clearly established.\n\n2.4–3.5 seconds: The shot further pulls back to a tight head-and-shoulders close-up, revealing the pink scarf and white-orange futuristic armor. High-altitude wind gradually intensifies, gently lifting the scarf toward the right side of the frame—movement soft and fluid, never obscuring the face or crossing the body. The heroine’s expression remains firm and composed, silent.\n\nAt approximately 3.5 seconds, the single hovering robot enters the scene naturally from behind and to the left of the heroine.\n\n3.5–4.8 seconds: The camera pulls back to mid-shot. The robot steadily flies alongside the heroine’s left shoulder, its fans rotating continuously, body exhibiting only slight vertical oscillation, while the central cyan eye glows steadily. The robot must not abruptly rush in, circle, or obstruct the character. The scarf interacts subtly with the robot’s airflow.\n\nAt around 4.8 seconds, the shot reveals the heroine’s full upper body, mechanical prosthetic limb, and the primary architectural structure behind her.\n\n4.8–5.8 seconds: The camera continues pulling back to a long-distance full-body shot, showing the heroine standing on a narrow platform at the edge of the base. Her posture is stable and natural, weight balanced, clothing and prosthetic limb structure unchanged. The robot remains at a reasonable distance behind and to the left. The scene opens with floating tracks, pipelines, orange-and-white shipping containers, and a sea of clouds below.\n\nAt approximately 5.8 seconds, as the rhythmic pace intensifies continuously, the camera enters the full-environment reveal phase.\n\nFrom 5.8 to 6.9 seconds: The camera continues to smoothly pull back, expanding the frame into an ultra-wide shot. It fully reveals the massive concrete structure, suspended industrial framework, observation towers, containers, turbulent cloud formations, and a distant colossal coral-red sun. The scale of the architecture remains consistent, spatial depth is clearly defined, and the clouds move slowly and naturally.\n\nAt around 6.9 seconds—the final distinct rhythmic beat—the composition reaches its most complete and grand scale.\n\nFrom 6.9 to 8 seconds: The camera's backward movement gradually slows down and stabilizes for a smooth conclusion. The female protagonist and robot become clearly defined small-scale subjects within the vast architecture and cloudscape. Her scarf continues to gently flutter in the wind; the robot remains steadily suspended; the distant sun stays fixed. For the final 0.5 seconds, no new elements should be introduced—allow the wide shot to settle naturally and end.\n\n[Visual & Material Style]\n\nHigh-quality stylized 3D cutscene animation with restrained semi-realistic cartoon rendering. Character skin appears natural and matte, preserving volume and fine textures; armor features clean spray-painted metal and composite materials; concrete shows subtle weathering and structural joints; clouds possess soft volumetric quality. The color palette emphasizes blue-green, beige, orange, and coral red, with pink used sparingly for the scarf and side lighting accents. The image is bright and transparent, featuring high-altitude atmospheric perspective. Avoid cheap blue lighting, particle clutter, excessive bloom, plastic-like surfaces, or any overt AI-generated artifacts.\n\n[Camera Requirements]\n\nSingle continuous take. The camera moves steadily backward along the protagonist’s line of sight, starting slightly faster in the first half and gradually decelerating toward the end. Focus transitions naturally from her eyes to her face, then to the full environment. The shot must remain stable, fluid, and cinematic—no handheld shake, abrupt zooms, rotation around the character, or changes to her orientation.\n\n[Sound Requirements]\n\nAudio style, rhythm, spatiality, and emotional tone should reference @audio1 from 0:00 to 0:08. Retain the core musical track without adding dialogue. Ambient sounds may only include very subtle high-altitude wind, fabric rustling of the scarf, and low-frequency duct fans from the robot. Ambient audio must never overpower the reference music.\n\n[Critical Restrictions]\n\nOnly one female protagonist and one robot are allowed. Do not generate multiple characters from different views in the design draft. No additional characters, robots, aircraft, weapons, text, subtitles, logos, or watermarks. Prohibit facial feature drift, hairstyle changes, clothing color shifts, prosthetic limb repositioning, character mirroring, cross-eyed gaze, extra fingers or limbs. No robot duplication, fan count alteration, mechanical arm growth, or body melting. Prevent scarf clipping, building distortion, container floating, rapid cloud churning, sun flickering, or sudden size changes. No cuts, black screens, white flashes, dissolves, shape-shifting transitions, or PowerPoint-style shot changes throughout."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [369.984375, 389.984375], "pos": [-1480, 6000], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [282], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["66303ed8fc66d7ee6fe16d8bc1d43ebdf5187c78e4bde5e8c6606af11638d7d0.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [289.984375, 329.984375], "pos": [-592.4509887695312, 5629.04296875], "id": 139, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE"